Z||000000||phreakboy4||12-04-2001||03:11 PM||||I was wondering if anyone knows any good websites that relate to making you own dashes and working with fiberglass, Im really interested in making my own interior, but im just not sure where to start||||reg||1
Z||000001||GTFiero1||12-04-2001||04:31 PM||||i dunno if it will help but check out the newest HOTROD magazine. on pg 72-74 it show you how to make fiberglass part replicas, they take a piece of trim from an old chevy, make a plaster mold of it and all. it show you how to do it and what materials you would need. but i would say, start off making smaller fiberglass parts and go from there, it'll be easier and give ya a chance to learn from your mistakes<P>------------------<BR>Adam J. B.<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_3.jpg">   <BR>you gotta keep on keepin on...<BR>IM AOL: GTFiero &  Rumpdetective (dont ask)||||reg||1
